'[Mission Dialog]'
STRDLGLINE000 = "Infiltrate the building through the skylight and look for "Tier One" officers.";
STRDLGLINE001 = "Blow the reinforced bunker door with a satchel charge.";
STRDLGLINE002 = "The Habr Gedir leaders are escaping! Follow them!";
STRDLGLINE003 = "Destroy the Weapon Crates";

'[info]'
Title = "Russian Underground";
briefing = "Russian Underground
Date:  September 10, 1993 - 0700 hours
Location:  Mogadishu, Somalia 

Situation:
We have reports of a large Habr Gadir clan meeting happening today in a complex built by the Soviets. We're sending in teams to capture as many of them as we can find. If we're lucky, one will talk and give us information on Aidid.

";
briefing2 = "<cFC8932>Russian Underground<-co>
OPORD: 5-93 TFR Date Time: 100700 September 93 

1. <ucFC8932>Situation<-uco>    
A number of high ranking Habr Gedir leaders and militia are planning a strategy meeting this afternoon in a former Soviet military complex.
      <cFC8932>Weather:<-co>  Hazy, hot, high clouds.
      <cFC8932>Terrain:<-co> City Center, urban.
      <cFC8932>Enemy:<-co>  Unknown. At least 20 militia. Possible technicals.
      <cFC8932>Friendly:<-co> None

2. <ucFC8932>Mission<-uco> 
      <cFC8932>Who:<-co> Delta Teams 1, 3, 5, 160th SOAR
      <cFC8932>What:<-co> Helo insert, secure Habr Gedir officials.
      <cFC8932>When:<-co> 1545 hours

3. <ucFC8932>Execution<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Commanders Intent:<-co>  Capture as many Habr Gedir as possible while avoiding civilian casualties..
      <cFC8932>Concept of Operation:<-co>  All teams will make a fast insertion via helo into the center of the complex. Teams will split up, secure prisoners and meet helos at the extraction point.

4. <ucFC8932>Service and Support<-uco>
      <cFC8932>Basic Load:<-co>  CAR15, Colt .45, AT-4, Night Vision Goggles

5. <ucFC8932>Command and signal<-uco>
Task Force chain of command in effect.  Command will coordinate from base. Hand and arm signals TACSOP, with higher via FM primary and SATCOM alternate.  Standard unit CEOI
";

